  "faithful": "Engraving, the real connoisseur and of politeness. Engraving in this country sustained a heavy loss when he died; and if the death of so excellent an artist may be considered as a public loss, it is certainly the more felt with respect to Woollett, who died while he was yet improving in that excellence (b).",
